, "一个年轻女性站立在窗前，侧身回眸，一只手轻轻搭在窗框上，光线柔和地洒在她的身上，构图平衡自然"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 146, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 125, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 28}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [11], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [788.2482299804688, 109.19548797607422], "pos": [896.1751708984375, 582.7263793945312], "widgets_values": ["我需要9段文本提示词。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 16, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [12], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [792.3984375, 272.16485595703125], "pos": [893.0301513671875, 261.2622375488281], "widgets_values": ["我正在提示一个图像编辑模型！\n我需要（文本）提示词来描述：从多个相机角度和不同姿势来显示这个角色，必须是日常生活拍照的套图姿势。\n必须100%严格遵守以下几点：\n1：必须100%严格保持角色的服装一致、背景一致、原图人物的全部相貌特征、面部骨相、五官形状与比例、脸型轮廓、总体外观的一致性。只能描述相机角度、角色的姿势和构图，不能描述角色相貌！\n2：必须100%严格遵守：“不能描述背景，人物相貌，服装”\n3：只有提示，没有其他输出，换行符分隔，没有空格。\n4：必须使用中文描述！"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 30, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOf